(Mikkelsen) was relatively calm compared to the situation.
We offered to help him with the dog, Antti Soini says in a message sent to Ilta-Sanomat.
Soon there happened to be a German man who was carrying a camping mattress.
From the mattress to Cita, we went on a strench where the injured dog was attached.
The German man showed up a moment after us, when we had thought about what to do with the dog and carried the dog down from the sill for a while in his lap, Soini says.
PHOTO: Tuomo Soini
The dog was carried down with the help of a camping mattress.
According to Soini, the performance was not physically heavy, but in difficult terrain the carrying went slowly.
However, after about an hour and a half, Cita was happily brought down.
After what happened, Mikkelsen was still looking for "international heroes" on Facebook so that he could thank them once again.
