Britan Isabelle Roberts roared so loudly when ice-cold water was poured oven on her that she damaged the bones in her face.
This Ice Bucket challenge ended painfully badly.
The woman has been taken to treatment since she roared the Ice Bucket challenge so hard that her jawbone was dislocated.
Isabelle Roberts roared so loudly when ice-cold water was poured oven on her that she damaged the structure of her face.
