That victory opened the doors to the cream of Europe.
Everything looked good.
There were promising young people, such as Hanno Möttölä.
Head coach Henrik Dettmann lifted Möttölä to the rest of the tournament team on the lime lines.
A solution that many disagreed with.
Now you can say Dettmann was wise from afar, even though everything didn't go according to the script.
